      "shareUrn": "urn:li:share:7474796281169719296",
      "content": "One of the riskiest moves right now is staying at a company that isn’t pushing forward with AI. \n\n3 easy ways to not move at the pace of your employer. \n\n1. Create a side hustle with AI \n\n2. Be the one to drive AI adoption\n\n3. Get a new employer",
