    {
      "type": "post",
      "id": "7482056353767710720",
      "entityId": "7482056353767710720",
      "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/woodsrach_this-weekend-i-was-at-a-mastermind-with-about-activity-7482056353767710720-NG7P",
      "shareLinkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7482056351418863616",
      "shareUrn": "urn:li:share:7482056351418863616",
      "content": "This weekend I was at a mastermind with about 400 people. And something magical happened.\n\nI shared a story of me getting extremely sick earlier this year.\n\nAnd from bed, I still got 8+ hours of work done.\n\nHow? Because AI ran my playbooks without me. \n\nI then walked through playbooking, how to create them, and I watched it click for everyone. \n\nPeople came up to me after, one after another they said some version of the same thing. \"Oh my gosh, it makes total sense. I could have playbooks for all of these things.\" \n\nAnd then their mind jumps to what that would free up. More time with their kids. Room to actually grow the business. A way out of all the operational debt they have been carrying.\n\n** still gives me chills ** \n\nTHIS is what I want everyone to see. And if you aren't playbooking yet - I want to help you get there. \n\nThat's why I'm hosting a free class this week going deep on the Playbooking Method. 90 minutes covering what playbooks are, what tools to run them in, how to create them, and how to find them inside your work. \n\nI want you to have the experience those 400 people had. \n\nThat feeling never gets old for me. And it made me want to make sure you get the same shot at it.\n\n--\n\nComment below if you'd like an invite and I'll DM it to you :)",
